@host = https://localhost:7121

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Semantic similarity (Development only)
POST {{host}}/dev/similarity
Content-Type: application/json


--RagDocsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-contract.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

### Delete a document (paste an id from the list)
DELETE {{host}}/documents/<id>


### Search (no AI answer, just the best chunks)
POST {{host}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How much notice do I need to give to end the contract?",
  "topK": 3
}

### Preview: search + prompt + answer (Development only)
POST {{host}}/dev/ask-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How much notice do I need to give to end the contract?" }

### Ask (streams; REST Client shows it when complete)
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "When do invoices have to be paid?" }